## The One Line Pitch

> "A multiplayer chaos game where the laws of physics are decided by democracy — and democracy always chooses violence."

---

## Why This Gets Built In April

- Rust skills from March carry directly into this
- WASM is the next logical step after CLI Rust
- Ships in 4 weeks with the phased approach
- Immediately playable and shareable
- Completely different from Astra — shows range
- Goes viral on its own merit

cipher was never found. now it's a game. 🎮